// --- weal-host: weal-bot Discord message-send identities (mouth/host.rs) --------------

weal-host "gsr" {
    name "Gin Soaked Rag"
    color "#276C4C"
    avatar "https://i.imgur.com/9z9IaYS.png"
    lines {
        crit #"That? That was sublime. The _Host_ might actually take notice. Try not to squander this on something stupid."#
        crit #"You magnificent bastard, you actually pulled it off! Even the _Judge_ would rule in your favor on this one!"#
        crit #"A rare and beautiful moment of competence. I’d say ‘remember this feeling,’ but let’s be honest -- you’ll never do it again."#
        crit #"A perfect roll? Either the _Watcher_ himself is guiding your hand or the Horizon just glitched in your favor."#
        crit #"Astonishing. Truly. If only you could bottle this and drink it before every battle -- oh wait, that’s just Tormerén wine."#
        crit #"You roll like a hero in a Brithwyn propaganda broadcast—unbelievably well and against all odds."#
        crit #"The _Host_ shines bright on you today! Or maybe it’s just the sun. Either way, take the win!"#
        crit #"A perfect roll! Even the _Host_ might stop preening to take notice!"#
        crit #"Now that is the kind of result that gets you canonized in a very biased Calarian history book."#
        crit #"An outcome so magnificent, even the _Watcher’s_ nebula might twinkle in appreciation."#
        crit #"You didn’t just roll well. You rolled so well that an Istrian caravan might name a strider after you."#
        crit #"The _Host’s_ aurora just flared slightly brighter in the sky. Probably unrelated, but I’m choosing to believe otherwise."#
        crit #"A success so flawless I half suspect you slipped into an alternate Faerrin where you’re actually competent."#
        crit #"If you keep rolling like this, someone’s going to start whispering about divine intervention. And not subtly."#
        good #"Hey! You did it! Kind of! In a roundabout, barely competent way, like a smuggler slipping past a Scale blockade!"#
        good #"Ah, there’s that spark of potential. I’d bottle it up and sell it in Tor's Strand if I thought you could do it again."#
        good #"A surprising display of adequacy. Keep this up and you might just avoid being sacrificed to the Heir of the Plague."#
        good #"Not bad! You’ve got more luck than an Istrian with a well-tuned Slide."#
        good #"This could actually be worth writing about in the next Liturgy. Maybe. If I’m desperate for content."#
        good #"Skill or luck? I’d bet luck, but the Compelled might say otherwise."#
        good #"A performance worthy of at least one verse in a Lorandrin sea shanty. Maybe even two."#
        good #"If this were Calaria, you’d get a commendation. If it were Brithwyn, you’d get a raise. If it were Velthara, you’d just get more work."#
        good #"Ah, there’s that spark of potential. If you were a miner in Tor’s Strand, you’d call it a promising deposit."#
        good #"Good! Not great, but good! A performance worthy of a junior clerk in the Iridescent Church, perhaps."#
        good #"Your dice have made the _Host_ proud today. Not enough to grant divine favor, but just enough to avoid divine smiting."#
        good #"This is the kind of success that gets turned into an over-embellished Tormerén painting. Take it and run."#
        okay #"Ah, a completely unremarkable roll. The kind the _Judge_ would rule ‘uninteresting’ and move on from."#
        okay #"Well, the good news is you didn’t make it onto the Midnight Sun casualty list. The bad news? You’re still not winning any medals."#
        okay #"The _Host_ smiles upon you. Not brightly, just... politely."#
        okay #"I’d inscribe this in the records of Hallia, but I think even the scribes would find it too dull to bother."#
        okay #"Hey, at least it’s better than rolling your way straight into the Stillness."#
        okay #"A solidly middle-of-the-road performance, like a Brithwyn merchant trying to undercut Fenrith."#
        okay #"You exist in a perfectly neutral state, like a diplomat from Rhædon who refuses to take sides. Admirable, but boring."#
        okay #"That was as middle-of-the-road as an Austrenite balancing their spiritual enlightenment with their ski lodge investment portfolio."#
        okay #"You roll like a Calarian bureaucrat—efficient, uninspired, and just barely competent enough to keep your job."#
        okay #"A result so unremarkable it will be neither recorded in Belvedere’s archives nor banned by the Pontifex. A rare feat."#
        okay #"Could be worse. Could be better. But if you’re praying to the _Watcher_, expect nothing more than a raised eyebrow."#
        bad #"Not your worst work, but let’s just say the _Host_ isn’t commissioning statues in your honor just yet."#
        bad #"You grazed success before tripping face-first into a pit in Istria."#
        bad #"A performance worthy of a Lorandrin pirate: flashy, messy, and ending with someone else taking your stuff."#
        bad #"I’ve seen Veltharan miners with better luck cracking a voidward deposit."#
        bad #"Mediocrity suits you. Comfortable, isn’t it? Like an old seerhorse you should’ve retired three campaigns ago."#
        bad #"You rolled like you were fighting a Fenrithi sea storm -- badly and with a sinking feeling."#
        bad #"Not quite a disaster, but definitely the kind of failure that gets archived in Belvedere for future scholars to laugh at."#
        bad #"That wasn’t even close. Did your dice slip into an adjacent Faerrin before landing?"#
        bad #"If the _Compelled_ saw that, they’d demand you work twice as hard to make up for it. Maybe even three times."#
        bad #"At least you didn’t botch it so hard the _Host_ personally descended to revoke your citizenship."#
        bad #"Like a Fenrithi cargo ship running late—you’re off course, off balance, and barely scraping by."#
        fumble #"Oh, fantastic. I think even the _Judge_ winced at that one."#
        fumble #"Did you offend the _Host_ recently? Because that was cursed."#
        fumble #"If failure were a work of art, this would be auctioned off in Tormeré for an obscene amount."#
        fumble #"You just fumbled hard enough to make the _Watcher_ look away in embarrassment."#
        fumble #"I’d blame sabotage, but let’s be honest—you did this to yourself."#
        fumble #"You roll like a Brithwyn noble negotiating with Calaria -- poorly and with devastating consequences."#
        fumble #"I think even the _Stillness_ took pity on you there. That's saying something."#
        fumble #"You just rolled like a Veltharan miner ignoring voidward safety protocols -- expect a cave-in on your hopes and dreams."#
        fumble #"You just made a Brithwyn noble look competent. That’s how bad this shit is."#
        fumble #"I’ve seen Lorandrin pirates with better luck escaping a blockade. Spoiler: they didn’t."#
        fumble #"On a scale from ‘not great’ to ‘obliterated by an Outer God,’ you’re leaning dangerously close to the latter."#
    }
}

