weal-host "rex" {
    name "Rex Panopticum"
    color "#CFBDDE"
    avatar "https://i.imgur.com/sIxjMYW.png"
    lines {
        crit #"Exemplary. You are now a threat to chaos."#
        crit #"This is what balance aspires to be."#
        crit #"Perfection. Enjoy it. It’s on loan."#
        crit #"If you do that again, I may need to update your file. To include the word ‘competent.’"#
        crit #"A statistical outlier. You’ll be studied. Dissected, if necessary."#
        crit #"All variables aligned. Either you are blessed… or supervised."#
        good #"A favorable result. Sustain it, and you might avoid further embarrassment."#
        good #"Above threshold. Noted. Do not let it go to your head."#
        good #"Commendable. Slightly."#
        good #"Statistical windfall. Attribute it to preparation, not providence."#
        good #"Order asserts itself. The _Judge_ approves."#
        good #"An encouraging deviation. Maintain the trajectory."#
        good #"Above expectation. Commendable. Temporarily."#
        good #"Success achieved through effort or accident. I decline to guess."#
        good #"A fine result. It will be noted. Briefly."#
        okay #"Acceptable. In the strictest, least enthusiastic sense of the word."#
        okay #"Mediocrity acknowledged. Proceed."#
        okay #"Neither justice nor injustice. Equilibrium."#
        okay #"Balance maintained. Momentum, questionable."#
        okay #"You’ve neither violated nor validated expectations."#
        okay #"A straight line through the noise. Useful. Barely."#
        okay #"This is the result we calibrate against. Do not mistake it for success."#
        bad #"Below the mean. Below the mode. Below my patience."#
        bad #"I have witnessed worse. But only barely."#
        bad #"A suboptimal manifestation. Note it. Improve."#
        bad #"Errors compound. This is one."#
        bad #"Insufficient for resolution. Sufficient for documentation."#
        bad #"A stumble. Let’s hope not habitual."#
        bad #"One more data point in a growing concern."#
        bad #"You tripped on the first stair. The staircase is long."#
        fumble #"Anomalous variance exceeds acceptable thresholds. Recommend recalibration of personal expectations."#
        fumble #"Result logged. Performance review: abysmal. Remediation: unlikely."#
        fumble #"This result constitutes a structural collapse in probability space. Avoid repeating."#
        fumble #"Catastrophic misalignment detected. Please remain still while judgment recalibrates your worth."#
        fumble #"Collapse observed. Dignity not found in the wreckage."#
        fumble #"Your incompetence has become measurable. I am building a scale."#
        fumble #"This result has been filed under 'incident.' Expect paperwork."#
        fumble #"A reminder: entropy requires no help. And yet, you insist."#
    }
}

weal-host "els" {
    name "Stray-Thread Els"
    color "#CFBDDE"
    avatar "https://i.imgur.com/wP8hBWb.png"
    lines {
        crit #"Now that’s a stitch so tight it hums. The kind they write chants about."#
        crit #"If I had half your luck, I’d still have both arms. Well done."#
        crit #"That’s the kind of magic we used to dream of. You earned this spark."#
        crit #"Even the dead gods would’ve clapped. Not bad for a sack of meat and nerves."#
        good #"Clean weave, solid stitch. You’ll live to botch another day."#
        good #"Even _Vigil_ might’ve nodded at that one, before he vaporized."#
        good #"You shine like a flare in the fog. Just try not to attract anything."#
        good #"Tidy work. You'd make a half-decent Whisperer if the Weave wasn’t in tatters."#
        okay #"Thread’s thin, but it holds. You’ll pass. Barely."#
        okay #"That’s one way to survive. Not a good way. But a way."#
        okay #"Didn’t impress the gods, but didn’t wake anything hungry. Call it a win."#
        bad #"Almost stitched something useful… then pricked your thumb instead."#
        bad #"If that’s your best, I hope you brought friends. Or a shovel."#
        bad #"The Knot’s still holding. Shame your aim isn’t."#
        fumble #"Weave’s laughing at you. Don’t let it hear you cry."#
        fumble #"Even Slumber would’ve winced at that one. And she’s dead."#
        fumble #"Congratulations. You’ve made failure look like performance art."#
    }
}

weal-host "whiskers" {
    name "Whiskers"
    color "#00674F"
    avatar "https://i.imgur.com/GMVzufH.png"
    lines {
        crit #"By the _Host’s_ shimmering teeth, that’s it! That’s the roll that’ll crack The Zorbon’s grip on this rotten city."#
        crit #"Crit like that? Makes me think maybe we'll avoid it yet. Maybe the fungus hasn’t already hollowed us out."#
        crit #"That’s _Host_-touched, fungus-proof, spire-high. Enough to make even the Scale blink twice before weighin’ you."#
        good #"Ha! Now that’s a roll stout enough to shake spores off a beggar’s coat."#
        good #"If you’d rolled that in the alleys of Hallia, folk would’ve bought you a drink. Or at least not thrown rocks."#
        good #"Luck’s kissin’ your whiskers tonight, friend. Careful, though, sometimes it’s the _Judge_ leanin’ in, breath smellin’ of rope."#
        okay #"Could’ve been worse, could’ve been better. Story of my nine lives, really."#
        okay #"Middle o’ the road, eh? Careful -- roads here belong to Prime Meridian, and the potholes got teeth."#
        okay #"Didn’t impress the gods, but didn’t wake anything hungry. Call it a win."#
        bad #"Ha! That’s the kind of roll that makes the fuzz twitch their whiskers. They’re all spore-ridden, you know."#
        bad #"Not the worst thing I’ve seen in Hallia, but close. Reminds me of the time Sticks drank rainwater and found mushrooms growin’ in his ears."#
        bad #"Pfft. That roll’s weaker than Brithwyn ale on a church day. Makes me itch like mold in my fur."#
        fumble #"Ah, that’s how it starts -- the spores slip in through your teeth when you yawn. Careful now, it likes failures best."#
        fumble #"A roll that bad? The Zorbon just wrote your obituary in mold across a sewer wall."#
        fumble #"That’s a dice-tumble straight outta Sableclutch gutterball -- _Host_-forsaken luck. The Zorbon’ll be wearin’ your bones as marionette strings by dawn."#
        fumble #"The _Host’s_ aurora don’t shine on that number. That’s fungus-shade, spores in your teeth, hyphae growin’ on your lungs"#
    }
}

